      "writtenOn": "2025-03-17T20:34:40Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Chris, can you provide an example (perhaps a link to an unmerged CL) of how you intended to use this, so we can discuss how to implement it?\n\nColin, Pirama: note that ART_USE_SIMULATOR is not something we intend to use in production; this will only be used by ART/ARM developers. The usual host/target assumptions break here because we want to run simulator on x86_64 and simulate arm64 - the arch switch is not static and happens at runtime when the control flow goes to/from simulator, so different parts of ART have to be built for different arches.",
      "parentUuid": "2cb8923e_08b7289b",
      "revId": "99fd863014bffe145d795858c4a5c01a5d44e47c",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
